alse},"discussion":{"id":684546,"discussion_content":"关键在于，你要让agent工作的场景是什么，至少现在，agent在发散型思维上远远不如人类，通常更适合的是让agent做已经有过总结和方法论的领域。而这些领域，通过设置人设更好的激发agnet专注做事情更重要","content_length":272,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1776915559,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":406851,"user_name":"葫芦娃","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1969599,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"3B33204BC77D04","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/0d/bf/aa2d6ba8.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1776176310,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":151312,"content":"往后学吧，模块4就是讲这个","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1776343640,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":406851,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"老师，你好，我基于我的疑惑点想和你交流一下。\n我在公司中做我们公司业务的Agent落地，我们的目标是“为每一个业务角色，实现为一个Agent”。那我在落地过程中，碰到的场景和老师演示的用例完全不一样。\n\n首先老师的案例是在“实现一件事情”\n而我的业务目标“是一个Agent能代替一个业务角色”\n这个目标带来的不同是：你会只聚焦于实现这一件事情来实现。\n但我们在公司中作为一个角色中的一个员工：会面临不同的业务场景，不同的业务场景会对应不同的流程，针对不同的流程会做出不同的判断和行动。\n\n比如以你举的例子：我作为一个团队中的研发，他会面临：\n（1）来了一个新需求，我基于新需求去理解需求，写代码，自测，上线，这是最常规的事情。\n（2）面临需求变更，研发会有应对需求变更的流程\n（3）面对一个需求临时不上了，我们有对应的流程\n\n其实对于研发角色的场景比较纯粹，在真实业务场景中，做一个订单的履约时，负责履约的业务人员会有更多的针对不同的场景有不同的处理流程这种问题。\n\n所以我的问题是：当我们Agent的目标不是聚焦于一件事情，而是聚焦于一个角色，一个角色本身会对应不同的场景有不同的处理流程，那我们的设计架构应该是怎样的？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":684223,"discussion_content":"往后学吧，模块4就是讲这个","content_length":37,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1776343640,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":406070,"user_name":"小团","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2028952,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"B81FD9742B1F22","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/f5/98/c490d236.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1773895334,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":150930,"content":"对，如果是直接传递，需要模型输出全文token，但是文件传递只需要输入token，输入token比输出token便宜，而且输出token要耗时","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1774072604,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":406070,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"&quot;高级技巧：报告撰写研究员写完一节后，将其保存为本地文件，然后触发 Delegate 唤醒报告审核编辑去读取该文件进行审核。&quot;这里有个问题：\n“报告审核编辑”最终不还是要把文件内容读入，然后再输出吗？这里是说通过文件传书的方式，审核编辑只输出审核意见即可，无需再把几万字的内容再输出一遍的意思吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":682602,"discussion_content":"对，如果是直接传递，需要模型输出全文token，但是文件传递只需要输入token，输入token比输出token便宜，而且输出token要耗时","content_length":163,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1774072604,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":405939,"user_name":"Koyi","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3183457,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"D4115B2852FCE8","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/30/93/61/791d0f5e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1773404656,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":150849,"content":"其实不是，学到后面会有很多模式","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1773732742,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":405939,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"所以muti agent中多agent任务协调其实是把一个agent作为另一个agent的tool交由另一个agent进行调用是嘛，如果我自定义一个工具，工具的内容就是调用另一个agent，是不是能达到相同的效果","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":682426,"discussion_content":"其实不是，学到后面会有很多模式","content_length":45,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1773732742,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":405874,"user_name":"Pure","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2666197,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"B740106D57090A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/28/ae/d5/38f9281c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1773203162,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"思考题-个人观点：客观来看，Multi-Agent 系统在良好设计下，其可靠性可以远超 Single-Agent，因为它具备错误隔离、监督纠错、细粒度恢复等能力。而“节点越多越脆弱”的观点成立的前提是系统缺乏容错机制，任由错误在节点间传播。因此，关键在于如何设计 Multi-Agent 的协作流程和异常处理策略。正如老师给出的示例代码所示，通过明确的角色分工、任务依赖、委托规范和审核反馈，Multi-Agent 能够稳健地完成复杂任务，这正是